// XlethAddon.cpp — Node-API bridge for the Xleth engine  (Phase 1)
//
// Uses node-addon-api (C++ wrapper around raw host bridge).
// HOST_BRIDGE_DISABLE_CPP_EXCEPTIONS is defined via CMake; functions that can fail
// call JsonApi::Error::New(env, msg).ThrowAsJavaScriptException() and return early.
//
// Threading model:
//   Node.js main thread  — all host bridge exported functions
//   JUCE audio RT thread — AudioEngine callback (no host bridge calls)
//   Video thread         — preview frame pacing at ~60 Hz (no host bridge calls)
//
// Phase 1 additions:
//   • Timeline data model (tracks, clips, regions, sources)
//   • UndoManager — ALL mutations go through execute(Command)
//   • ProjectManager — create / save / load project
//   • MixEngine wired to Timeline + peak meters
//   • Transport seek

